PASS B3 the induced distance moduli differ from LCDM (Omega_m = 0.315) by 0.39 mag at z = 0.5 (SN-Ia distances constrain to ~0.02 mag): the offset-as-dark-energy reading with a0 ~ H(z) is excluded by the acceleration itself; a0 ~ H(z) is then a different world (no offset-dark-energy)
PASS B4 CONTROL: the same integration reproduces D_L(LCDM) -> EdS when Omega_m = 1 (distance modulus offset 0 at all z)

